@startuml 家庭成员提议分类 - 管理员审核流程
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam participantBorderColor #4A90D9
skinparam participantFontColor #333333
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #E8F0FE
skinparam arrowColor #333333
skinparam lifeLineBorderColor #4A90D9
skinparam lifeLineBackgroundColor #4A90D9

actor "家庭成员" as Member
actor "家庭管理员" as Admin
boundary "前端界面" as Frontend
control "分类控制器\nCategoryController" as Controller
boundary "分类服务\nCategoryService" as Service
entity "数据库\nMySQL" as DB

== 阶段一：家庭成员提交分类申请 ==

Member -> Frontend: 填写分类名称、收支类型\n点击"提交申请"
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Controller: POST /api/categories/apply\n{ name, type, familyId }
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: createCategoryApply(userId, dto)
activate Service

Service -> DB: INSERT INTO category_apply\n(status='PENDING')
activate DB
DB --> Service: 返回申请ID
deactivate DB

Service --> Controller: 返回申请记录
deactivate Service

Controller --> Frontend: 201 Created\n{ applyId, status: "PENDING" }
deactivate Controller

Frontend --> Member: 显示"申请已提交，\n等待管理员审核"
deactivate Frontend

== 阶段二：管理员查看待审核申请 ==

Admin -> Frontend: 进入"分类审核"页面
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Controller: GET /api/categories/applies\n?status=PENDING&familyId={id}
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: getPendingApplies(familyId)
activate Service

Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM category_apply\nWHERE status='PENDING' AND family_id={id}
activate DB
DB --> Service: 返回待审核申请列表
deactivate DB

Service --> Controller: 返回申请列表
deactivate Service

Controller --> Frontend: 200 OK\n[ { applyId, name, type, proposer, createdAt }, ... ]
deactivate Controller

Frontend --> Admin: 展示待审核申请列表
deactivate Frontend

== 阶段三：管理员审核 - 通过（合并到已有分类） ==

Admin -> Frontend: 选择"通过并合并到\n已有分类"
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Controller: PUT /api/categories/applies/{applyId}/approve\n{ mergeToCategoryId: xxx }
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: approveApply(applyId, mergeToCategoryId)
activate Service

' 1. 更新申请状态
Service -> DB: UPDATE category_apply\nSET status='APPROVED',\nmerge_to_category_id={id},\nreviewed_at=NOW()
activate DB
DB --> Service: OK
deactivate DB

' 2. 通知申请人
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO notification\n(userId, type, content, ...)
activate DB
DB --> Service: OK
deactivate DB

Service --> Controller: 返回审核结果
deactivate Service

Controller --> Frontend: 200 OK\n{ message: "审核通过，已合并" }
deactivate Controller

Frontend --> Admin: 显示"审核通过"
deactivate Frontend

== 阶段四：家庭成员收到通知 ==

Frontend -> Member: 推送通知\n"您的分类申请已通过，\n已合并至【xxx】分类"
note right: 或下次登录时拉取通知

@enduml
